ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh060: SHELL_BASED_SURFACE_MODEL with 8 disjoint OPEN_SHELLs each containing one ADVANCED_FACE; 8 independent shells IS wired into SHELL_BASED_SURFACE_MODEL as disjoint compound; no shared edges or vertices between shells (disjointness IS the mechanism); same-surface merge iterates all-pairs across compound rather than per-shell; O(N^2) candidate-pair iteration exposes quadratic complexity; fix: restrict candidate pairs to faces sharing an edge (connectivity grouping) */
